{"4747150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cockroach Simulation", "steam_appid": 4747150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero.<br>Not a warrior.<br>And not the protagonist of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are… a cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.poster.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.webm?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.mp4?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive inside the filthy, twisted house of an old hunter.<br>Scavenge for scraps of food, avoid deadly traps, and struggle to stay alive among creatures that can crush you at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this house, every crumb is hope.<br>Every footstep is death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.poster.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.webm?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.mp4?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cockroach Simulation</strong><br>A bizarre cockroach life simulator that blends comedy, horror, and despair into one unsettling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/c445ebe068c76dbfeb5c562958305c5b.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the life of a tiny insect inside a human home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for food in trash, delivery leftovers, and rotten scraps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the homeowner and other dangerous creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirty, disturbing, and intensely oppressive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game becomes harder as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and uncover the old man’s disturbing secrets</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a hero.<br>Not a warrior.<br>And not the protagonist of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are… a cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.poster.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.webm?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/9e33a746c2bc634e6215089ad4361b5a.mp4?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive inside the filthy, twisted house of an old hunter.<br>Scavenge for scraps of food, avoid deadly traps, and struggle to stay alive among creatures that can crush you at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this house, every crumb is hope.<br>Every footstep is death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.poster.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.webm?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/a5cb7cd942a83468f8ca1d23a0b6adc4.mp4?t=1782633678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cockroach Simulation</strong><br>A bizarre cockroach life simulator that blends comedy, horror, and despair into one unsettling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4747150/extras/c445ebe068c76dbfeb5c562958305c5b.avif?t=1782633678\" width=454 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the life of a tiny insect inside a human home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for food in trash, delivery leftovers, and rotten scraps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the homeowner and other dangerous creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dirty, disturbing, and intensely oppressive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game becomes harder as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and uncover the old man’s disturbing secrets</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Cockroach Simulation A terrifying insect-perspective survival horror game that w